    "detailed_description": "Your task is to get out of the maze.<br />\r\nFor this, you need to find the key!<br />\r\nBeware of bloodthirsty monsters, they are ready for anything to taste your flesh!<br />\r\nRun faster if they see you!<br />\r\nIn the game you have to go through a large number of levels,<br />\r\nEach has its own peculiarity!<br />\r\nAnd remember ... You must survive!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n- Many terrible monsters waiting for you at every step<br />\r\n- You have no weapons, all that you can do - run away!<br />\r\n- Various levels, many quests<br />\r\n- The further you went, the harder it is to get out!",
